{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S01、S05 这类短时段里，未标记到时出现的感受词仍然偏密，容易让扫读变成赶读；另外 S13 对“明知无人能保证永远”的心理表达有所改写，削弱了原来的因果准确性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点放大加亮，让观众不必读完每句话就能抓住人物当下的心理变化，感受词的小字层级和按音乐节点出现的安排，也让信息有了呼吸。水、船、波浪、光线和声线等反复出现的意象，使音乐感受与人物经历形成连续呼应，细腻程度明显胜过 X。X 的完整因果叙述更稳妥，尤其在解释人物为什么害怕失去、为什么想收回心意时更直接，但整体上 Y 给观众的体验更丰富，也更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "59ddaa36-0509-4910-abdf-c5a3183b58e2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172156198924Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:23:32.363130+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "baa55d7f9ba6800b70b8080fd6713d1cb71379742af15401efd4d0d469670e85", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3